  ('g2-s7-age-avg-0008', 2, 7, 'age_problems', 'average', '{"age": 9, "mult": 2}'::jsonb, 'Kaye is 9 years old now. In how many years will Kaye be 2 times as old as Kaye is right now?', '["7", "9", "18", "11"]'::jsonb, '9', '["multiplied the current age by the multiplier itself instead of by (multiplier − 1) — double-counts the starting age as part of the growth", "added the multiplier to the current age instead of finding how many years are needed to reach that multiple", "subtracted the multiplier from the current age instead of solving for the number of years"]'::jsonb, 'Kaye is 9 now. In y years, Kaye will be 9 + y, and that should equal 2 × 9. So y = 9 × (2 − 1) = 9 years.', NULL, 'Builds on the Easy tier''s age/years/multiplier relationship, run in the opposite direction: given the current age, solve for the missing number of years instead of the missing age.', 30, NULL, 'template-mtap-g2-s7-age-v1', true),
  ('g2-s7-age-diff-0001', 2, 7, 'age_problems', 'difficult', '{"m1": 5, "m2": 2, "years": 9, "b_now": 3}'::jsonb, 'Marco is currently 5 times as old as Isa. In 9 years, Marco will be 2 times as old as Isa will be then. How old is Marco now?', '["6", "60", "15", "24"]'::jsonb, '15', '["used the FUTURE multiple with Isa''s CURRENT age instead of the correct now-multiple", "gave Marco''s age in the future instead of Marco''s age right now — answers the wrong point in time", "used Marco''s now-multiple with Isa''s FUTURE age — mixed two different timepoints together"]'::jsonb, 'Let Isa''s age now be b. Then Marco''s age now is 5b. In 9 years, Marco will be 5b + 9 and Isa will be b + 9, and Marco = 2 × Isa at that point: 5b + 9 = 2(b + 9). Solving gives b = 3, so Marco is now 5 × 3 = 15.', NULL, 'Builds on the Average tier''s ''solve for an unknown using a multiplicative age relationship'' skill, adding a second person and a second timepoint tracked simultaneously.', 60, NULL, 'template-mtap-g2-s7-age-v1', true),
  ('g2-s7-age-diff-0002', 2, 7, 'age_problems', 'difficult', '{"m1": 3, "m2": 2, "years": 8, "b_now": 8}'::jsonb, 'Ravi is currently 3 times as old as Nico. In 8 years, Ravi will be 2 times as old as Nico will be then. How old is Ravi now?', '["32", "48", "16", "24"]'::jsonb, '24', '["used the FUTURE multiple with Nico''s CURRENT age instead of the correct now-multiple", "gave Ravi''s age in the future instead of Ravi''s age right now — answers the wrong point in time", "used Ravi''s now-multiple with Nico''s FUTURE age — mixed two different timepoints together"]'::jsonb, 'Let Nico''s age now be b. Then Ravi''s age now is 3b. In 8 years, Ravi will be 3b + 8 and Nico will be b + 8, and Ravi = 2 × Nico at that point: 3b + 8 = 2(b + 8). Solving gives b = 8, so Ravi is now 3 × 8 = 24.', NULL, 'Builds on the Average tier''s ''solve for an unknown using a multiplicative age relationship'' skill, adding a second person and a second timepoint tracked simultaneously.', 60, NULL, 'template-mtap-g2-s7-age-v1', true),
  ('g2-s7-age-diff-0003', 2, 7, 'age_problems', 'difficult', '{"m1": 4, "m2": 2, "years": 6, "b_now": 3}'::jsonb, 'Leon is currently 4 times as old as Dara. In 6 years, Leon will be 2 times as old as Dara will be then. How old is Leon now?', '["36", "12", "6", "18"]'::jsonb, '12', '["used the FUTURE multiple with Dara''s CURRENT age instead of the correct now-multiple", "gave Leon''s age in the future instead of Leon''s age right now — answers the wrong point in time", "used Leon''s now-multiple with Dara''s FUTURE age — mixed two different timepoints together"]'::jsonb, 'Let Dara''s age now be b. Then Leon''s age now is 4b. In 6 years, Leon will be 4b + 6 and Dara will be b + 6, and Leon = 2 × Dara at that point: 4b + 6 = 2(b + 6). Solving gives b = 3, so Leon is now 4 × 3 = 12.', NULL, 'Builds on the Average tier''s ''solve for an unknown using a multiplicative age relationship'' skill, adding a second person and a second timepoint tracked simultaneously.', 60, NULL, 'template-mtap-g2-s7-age-v1', true),
  ('g2-s7-age-diff-0004', 2, 7, 'age_problems', 'difficult', '{"m1": 6, "m2": 3, "years": 6, "b_now": 4}'::jsonb, 'Kian is currently 6 times as old as Faye. In 6 years, Kian will be 3 times as old as Faye will be then. How old is Kian now?', '["12", "60", "30", "24"]'::jsonb, '24', '["used the FUTURE multiple with Faye''s CURRENT age instead of the correct now-multiple", "gave Kian''s age in the future instead of Kian''s age right now — answers the wrong point in time", "used Kian''s now-multiple with Faye''s FUTURE age — mixed two different timepoints together"]'::jsonb, 'Let Faye''s age now be b. Then Kian''s age now is 6b. In 6 years, Kian will be 6b + 6 and Faye will be b + 6, and Kian = 3 × Faye at that point: 6b + 6 = 3(b + 6). Solving gives b = 4, so Kian is now 6 × 4 = 24.', NULL, 'Builds on the Average tier''s ''solve for an unknown using a multiplicative age relationship'' skill, adding a second person and a second timepoint tracked simultaneously.', 60, NULL, 'template-mtap-g2-s7-age-v1', true),
  ('g2-s7-age-diff-0005', 2, 7, 'age_problems', 'difficult', '{"m1": 3, "m2": 2, "years": 5, "b_now": 5}'::jsonb, 'Owen is currently 3 times as old as Mira. In 5 years, Owen will be 2 times as old as Mira will be then. How old is Owen now?', '["30", "20", "15", "10"]'::jsonb, '15', '["used the FUTURE multiple with Mira''s CURRENT age instead of the correct now-multiple", "gave Owen''s age in the future instead of Owen''s age right now — answers the wrong point in time", "used Owen''s now-multiple with Mira''s FUTURE age — mixed two different timepoints together"]'::jsonb, 'Let Mira''s age now be b. Then Owen''s age now is 3b. In 5 years, Owen will be 3b + 5 and Mira will be b + 5, and Owen = 2 × Mira at that point: 3b + 5 = 2(b + 5). Solving gives b = 5, so Owen is now 3 × 5 = 15.', NULL, 'Builds on the Average tier''s ''solve for an unknown using a multiplicative age relationship'' skill, adding a second person and a second timepoint tracked simultaneously.', 60, NULL, 'template-mtap-g2-s7-age-v1', true),
